urces/mit18_642_f24_lec21_pdf/index.html\">Risk Neutral Valuation, Black-Scholes Equation Slides (PDF)</a></p>\n\n    <h3 id=\"lecture-22\">Lecture 22</h3>\n\n<p>Guest lecture with Ross Garon, Millennium Management</p>\n<p>Lecture 22: The Spectrum of Systematic Trading Strategies in Liquid Instruments    <br>\nNote: This lecture is not available to OCW learners.</p>\n",
